---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Pech Group is a boutique executive advisory firm founded in 2025, headquartered in the San Francisco Bay Area with operations in Texas and Mexico. We bring 12+ years of multinational cross-border leadership to growth-stage and mid-market companies."
>

  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section__label">Who We Are</span>
      <h1>Executive leadership.<br/><span style="color:var(--gold)">No borders.</span></h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our story -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div class="about-grid__main">
        <span class="section__label">Our Story</span>
        <div class="gold-line"></div>
        <h2>Built from the inside out.</h2>
        <p>
          Pech Group was founded in 2025 on a straightforward premise: growth-stage
          and mid-market companies deserve access to Fortune-500-caliber executive
          leadership — without the cost, risk, and timeline of a traditional full-time hire.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our principals bring over 12 years of senior leadership at multinational
          operators with cross-border US–Mexico operations at scale. We have sat in
          the CEO chair, the boardroom, and the operating trenches. We have opened
          markets, turned around underperforming businesses, built binational teams,
          and navigated the regulatory and commercial complexity that defines the
          US–Mexico corridor.
        </p>
        <p>
          We launched as a boutique firm because we believe smaller, focused, and
          deeply embedded is better than large and generic. We work with a select
          number of clients at a time — and we bring our full attention to each one.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-grid__aside">
        <div class="about-card">
          <div class="about-card__stat">
            <span class="about-card__num">2025</span>
            <span class="about-card__label">Founded</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about-card__stat">
            <span class="about-card__num">12+</span>
            <span class="about-card__label">Years of binational executive experience</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about-card__stat">
            <span class="about-card__num">3</span>
            <span class="about-card__label">Countries of active operational footprint</span>
          </div>
          <div class="about-card__stat">
            <span class="about-card__num">EN/ES</span>
            <span class="about-card__label">Bilingual and bicultural — English and Spanish</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Philosophy -->
  <section class="section section--off">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section__label">Our Philosophy</span>
      <h2 class="section__heading">How we think about our work.</h2>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="philosophy-card">
          <div class="philosophy-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Results, not reports.</h3>
          <p>We are operators first. Our value is measured by what changes in your business, not by the quality of the slide decks we produce.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-card">
          <div class="philosophy-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 014 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 014-10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>The border is an advantage.</h3>
          <p>Most advisors treat the US–Mexico border as a complication. We have built our entire practice on treating it as a strategic opportunity.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-card">
          <div class="philosophy-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Skin in the game.</h3>
          <p>Our engagements include milestone-based fees tied to outcomes. When you win, we win. That alignment is not an add-on — it's how we work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-card">
          <div class="philosophy-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Boutique by design.</h3>
          <p>We limit the number of concurrent engagements deliberately. Depth of attention is a service we provide. We don't over-extend it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-card">
          <div class="philosophy-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="9 11 12 14 22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Honest scoping.</h3>
          <p>We tell you upfront when a problem is outside our scope or when a different type of expertise is needed. We don't expand engagements past their natural fit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-card">
          <div class="philosophy-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M15.536 15.536l.707.707M15.536 8.464l.707-.707M12 21v-1"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>AI-native from day one.</h3>
          <p>We run our own firm using autonomous AI agents. We don't recommend tools we haven't operated ourselves — which is the foundation of our Technology practice and PECH Labs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Binational identity -->
  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="container binational">
      <div class="binational__text">
        <span class="section__label" style="color:var(--gold)">Our Identity</span>
        <div class="gold-line"></div>
        <h2 style="color:var(--white)">Bilingual. Bicultural.<br/>Built for the corridor.</h2>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65)">
          The US–Mexico business relationship is one of the most consequential
          economic corridors in the world — and one of the most misunderstood.
          Surface-level bilingualism is not the same as deep operational fluency
          in both markets.
        </p>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65); margin-top:1rem;">
          We are genuinely bilingual and bicultural. We understand regulatory
          environments, business culture, stakeholder dynamics, and commercial
          practices on both sides. When we advise a US company on entering
          Mexico — or a Mexican company on operating in the US — we aren't
          reading from a market report. We're drawing on years of lived
          executive experience.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="binational__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="border-visual">
          <div class="border-visual__line"></div>
          <div class="border-visual__label border-visual__label--us">United States</div>
          <div class="border-visual__label border-visual__label--mx">México</div>
          <div class="border-visual__dot"></div>
          <div class="border-visual__text">Think Beyond Borders</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center; max-width:580px;">
      <h2>Working with us starts with a conversation.</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
        We don't do RFPs or intake questionnaires. If the fit looks right on both
        sides, we'll know quickly.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Get in Touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 7rem 0 5rem;
  }
  .page-header h1 { color: var(--white); margin: 0.5rem 0; }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about-grid__main { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .about-grid__main h2 { margin: 0.5rem 0; }

  .about-card {
    background: var(--navy);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .about-card__stat {}
  .about-card__num {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .about-card__label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .philosophy-card {
    padding: 2rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(1,8,45,0.08);
  }
  .philosophy-card__icon {
    width: 44px; height: 44px;
    background: rgba(202,173,135,0.1);
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .philosophy-card__icon svg {
    width: 20px; height: 20px;
    stroke: var(--gold);
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .philosophy-card h3 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; }
  .philosophy-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; }

  .binational {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .binational__text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }

  .border-visual {
    position: relative;
    height: 280px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(202,173,135,0.15);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .border-visual__line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
  }
  .border-visual__label {
    position: absolute;
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }
  .border-visual__label--us { top: 30%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
  .border-visual__label--mx { bottom: 30%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
  .border-visual__dot {
    width: 12px; height: 12px;
    background: var(--gold);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(202,173,135,0.6);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .border-visual__text {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1.5rem;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
    .binational { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .binational__visual { display: none; }
  }
</style>
